{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48938","headline":"蒙谷山 · 唐彦谦","name":"蒙谷山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蒙谷山低碧海枯，仲君闲坐说麻姑。\n遥天鹤语知虚实，长夜神光竟有无。\n秘祝斋心开九转，侍臣回首听三呼。\n交朋漫信文成术，短烛瑶坛漏满壶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}